Pagination — ko‘p sahifali ma’lumotlarni 1, 2, 3, 4... sahifalarga bo‘lib ko‘rsatish.
17. Pagination
<ul class="pagination">
    <li><a href="#">1</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">2</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">3</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">4</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">5</a></li>
</ul>
Active — hozirgi sahifa
<ul class="pagination">
    <li><a href="#">1</a></li>
    <li class="active"><a href="#">2</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">3</a></li>
</ul>
Disabled — bosib bo‘lmaydi
<ul class="pagination">
    <li><a href="#">1</a></li>
    <li class="disabled"><a href="#">2</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">3</a></li>
</ul>
Katta / kichik
<ul class="pagination pagination-lg">
    <li><a href="#">1</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">2</a></li>
</ul>

<ul class="pagination pagination-sm">
    <li><a href="#">1</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">2</a></li>
</ul>
Breadcrumbs

Breadcrumb — foydalanuvchi qaysi joyda turganini ko‘rsatadi.
<ul class="breadcrumb">
    <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Pictures</a></li>
    <li class="active">Vacation</li>
</ul>
//KEYWORD
.pagination     → pagination yaratadi
.active         → hozirgi sahifa
.disabled       → o‘chirilgan/bosib bo‘lmaydi
.pagination-lg  → katta
.pagination-sm  → kichik

.breadcrumb     → sahifa joylashuv yo‘li
Pagination  → 1  2  3  4  5
              ↓
         sahifalar orasida yurish

Breadcrumb  → Home > Pictures > Vacation
              ↓
         qayerda turganingni ko‘rsatish
17. Pagination
→ Ko‘p sahifali ma’lumotlarni sahifalarga bo‘ladi.
→ .pagination → pagination
→ .active → hozirgi sahifa
→ .disabled → o‘chirilgan sahifa
